{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-18T21:25:57.561Z","data":{"text":"Task 2 complete.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Implemented** the typed event union and write-time tool-summary relativization:\n\n- **`src/core/summary.ts`** (new): extracted `relativizeToolSummary` from the watcher.\n- **`src/watcher/heartbeat.ts`**: imports and re-exports it, duplicated body removed (177 lines).\n- **`src/harness/types.ts`**: added typed payloads for all 10 events, the `OsqEventData` map, and `OsqEvent`/`HarnessEvent` as a discriminated union over `type`.\n- **`src/watcher/spawn.ts`** (199 lines): `started` now carries `harness`, `model`, and `osqVersion` alongside the existing fields.\n- **`src/harness/opencode.ts` / `agy.ts`**: renamed the shared handler to `emitObservedToolEvent` and relativize summaries against `projectRoot` before writing; threaded `projectRoot` from each adapter.\n- **`src/harness/mock.ts`**: removed duplicate `started`/`exited` emissions.\n- **`tests/runner-lifecycle-logging.test.ts`**: added 6 tests covering every acceptance line.\n\n**Verification**\n- Task verify: 17 pass / 0 fail.\n- `pnpm tsc --noEmit` and `pnpm lint` clean.\n- Import-graph/tool-event/heartbeat suites: 39 pass / 0 fail.\n\n**Documented in `.run/results/2.md`**: two intentional deviations (optional legacy `VerifyRanEventData` fields and a legacy `started` payload member to keep out-of-scope `runner.ts`/`tests/harness.test.ts` compiling), plus one out-of-scope test conflict (`tests/harness.test.ts` still asserts MockAdapter lifecycle events, so full `pnpm test` is 498/499)."}}
